  "author_association": "OWNER",
  "body": "## What broke\n`rig-lattice.yml` installs `rig-lattice` from PyPI. PyPI returns 404 for that package, so this job has failed on every push since 2026-09-12 ([runs](https://github.com/mrodgersjs-web/strategy-studio/actions/workflows/rig-lattice.yml)).\n\n## What this changes\n- The `lattice` job now **skips** unless the repository variable `RIG_LATTICE_ENABLED` is `true`. A skipped job shows as skipped, never as a pass.\n- `actions/checkout` v4 to v5 and `actions/setup-python` v5 to v6 (Node 24). This clears the Node 20 deprecation warning.\n\n## Turning it back on\nOnce the scorer is installable, set `RIG_LATTICE_ENABLED` to `true` under Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions > Variables.\n\nCI-only change: one workflow file, no code or docs touched.",
